{"3590940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Adventure in Hender´s Castle", "steam_appid": 3590940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5139290], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a young wizard Exploring Hender's Castle, searching for a forbidden spell to speak with the dead so you can talk to your beloved grandmother one last time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590940/extras/43930d1b6bf95f59d9140600f6ca3c49.poster.avif?t=1787319056\" aria-label=\"Demonstration of a crafting mechanic, the player has to create an invocation circle and throw items inside it to craft some potions.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590940/extras/43930d1b6bf95f59d9140600f6ca3c49.webm?t=1787319056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590940/extras/43930d1b6bf95f59d9140600f6ca3c49.mp4?t=1787319056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw a magic circle and throw ingredients on it to craft magic items, you need a cauldron to brew potions, some spirits will let you use their powers for the right price. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590940/extras/54926a00f0e10fa4cdaf971e12f68463.poster.avif?t=1787319056\" aria-label=\"A 3d character talks with a ghost NPC, the camera zooms in on both of then\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590940/extras/54926a00f0e10fa4cdaf971e12f68463.webm?t=1787319056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590940/extras/54926a00f0e10fa4cdaf971e12f68463.mp4?t=1787319056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of the ghosts in the Castle are friendly and can exchange information and magical items with you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590940/extras/6ee955b3c598d49729d46d80a07dbe85.poster.avif?t=1787319056\" aria-label=\"A 3d character talks with an NPC, then monsters appear and combat begins.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590940/extras/6ee955b3c598d49729d46d80a07dbe85.webm?t=1787319056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590940/extras/6ee955b3c598d49729d46d80a07dbe85.mp4?t=1787319056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Castle is protected by an Entity with Magical Intelligence &quot;EMI&quot; it has the task to not let anyone inside the castle and it will do everything it can to stop you, the spell you're after is forbidden for good reasons, you will have to fight enemies, solve puzzles and grow your knowledge of spells and magic recipes to confront the challenges ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A non linear interconnected dungeon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you'll find a locked door before you find its key, and you'll have to remember it was there. Rooms connect back on themselves, shortcuts can open from the wrong side, and the way forward is for you to discover. there are no maps telling you where to go. The castle is yours to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590940/extras/ebb237955377f8e67c20be95b2aa7e3b.avif?t=1787319056\" alt=\"screenshot of an inventory interface a grid of items\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590940/extras_big/ebb237955377f8e67c20be95b2aa7e3b.avif?t=1787319056 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your pockets are not infinite. Every invocation costs ingredients, and you can't carry everything, manage your inventory and plan ahead what you might need. There are some ways to increase what you can carry. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is Made for people who like a dungeon they have to learn: interconnected, non-linear and filled  with secrets.</i>We wait for you inside the Castle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a young wizard Exploring Hender's Castle, searching for a forbidden spell to speak with the dead so you can talk to your beloved grandmother one last time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590940/extras/43930d1b6bf95f59d9140600f6ca3c49.poster.avif?t=1787319056\" aria-label=\"Demonstration of a crafting mechanic, the player has to create an invocation circle and throw items inside it to craft some potions.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590940/extras/43930d1b6bf95f59d9140600f6ca3c49.webm?t=1787319056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590940/extras/43930d1b6bf95f59d9140600f6ca3c49.mp4?t=1787319056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw a magic circle and throw ingredients on it to craft magic items, you need a cauldron to brew potions, some spirits will let you use their powers for the right price. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590940/extras/54926a00f0e10fa4cdaf971e12f68463.poster.avif?t=1787319056\" aria-label=\"A 3d character talks with a ghost NPC, the camera zooms in on both of then\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590940/extras/54926a00f0e10fa4cdaf971e12f68463.webm?t=1787319056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590940/extras/54926a00f0e10fa4cdaf971e12f68463.mp4?t=1787319056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of the ghosts in the Castle are friendly and can exchange information and magical items with you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590940/extras/6ee955b3c598d49729d46d80a07dbe85.poster.avif?t=1787319056\" aria-label=\"A 3d character talks with an NPC, then monsters appear and combat begins.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590940/extras/6ee955b3c598d49729d46d80a07dbe85.webm?t=1787319056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590940/extras/6ee955b3c598d49729d46d80a07dbe85.mp4?t=1787319056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Castle is protected by an Entity with Magical Intelligence &quot;EMI&quot; it has the task to not let anyone inside the castle and it will do everything it can to stop you, the spell you're after is forbidden for good reasons, you will have to fight enemies, solve puzzles and grow your knowledge of spells and magic recipes to confront the challenges ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A non linear interconnected dungeon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you'll find a locked door before you find its key, and you'll have to remember it was there. Rooms connect back on themselves, shortcuts can open from the wrong side, and the way forward is for you to discover. there are no maps telling you where to go. The castle is yours to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590940/extras/ebb237955377f8e67c20be95b2aa7e3b.avif?t=1787319056\" alt=\"screenshot of an inventory interface a grid of items\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590940/extras_big/ebb237955377f8e67c20be95b2aa7e3b.avif?t=1787319056 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your pockets are not infinite. Every invocation costs ingredients, and you can't carry everything, manage your inventory and plan ahead what you might need. There are some ways to increase what you can carry. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is Made for people who like a dungeon they have to learn: interconnected, non-linear and filled  with secrets.</i>We wait for you inside the Castle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Explore Hender’s Castle in a quest for a forbidden spell in this 3D action-adventure. Draw magic circles, brew potions, invoke spirits, ba